 win probability near 98 percent, and every major race rater labels the contest Solid or Safe Democratic. The race is effectively decided; the only question is the size of Reed's victory margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 18.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9957, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9949, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9974, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9952, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9973, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9968, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9965, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9977, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9986, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9965, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9973, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9941, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9967, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9977, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9965, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9968, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9972, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9992, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9995, "margin": 28.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 24.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9982, "margin": 23.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.9994, "margin": 27.0}]}